# Build artefacts of this thesis.
#
# 'thesis-cli init' copies this file into every new project, so a new
# project starts with its sources and its artefacts kept apart.
#
# Every kind of file 'thesis-cli clean' deletes is ignored here, except
# PostScript: the build never writes a .ps outside build/, so a .ps next to
# the sources is a figure. A few things clean leaves alone are ignored as
# well (ebb's bounding-box files, editor swap files, research data).

*.aux
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.blg
*.brf
*.dvi
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.idx
*.ilg
*.ind
*.loa
*.lof
*.log
*.lot
*.nav
*.out
*.run.xml
*.snm
*.spl
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.vrb
*.xdv
missfont.log
texput.log

# epstopdf output: an artefact, not an asset.
*-eps-converted-to.pdf

# Bounding-box files from ebb. Never commit them: they record the absolute
# path of the machine that generated them in a %%Title comment.
*.bb
*.xbb

# Output directory used by 'thesis-cli build'.
build/

# The compiled thesis goes to build/, which is ignored above. Uncommenting
# this ignores every other PDF as well, figures saved as .pdf included.
# *.pdf

# Editor and operating-system leftovers.
*.bak
*.asv
*~
*.swp
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Research data belongs outside the repository. Generate the figures from
# it with your own scripts; do not commit the raw files. Plain .dat files
# are not listed: pgfplots reads its tables from them.
data/
raw/
*.mat
*.wav
*.npy
*.npz
*.xlsx
